        "Content": "<ul><li>Spectacular 3-4 bedroomed corner Penthouse</li><li>Not overlooked front or rear</li><li>Magnificent panoramic views overlooking Farmleigh</li><li>Views to the Dublin Mountains, Farmleigh, Castleknock College and beyond </li><li>Four excellent terraces to enjoy the outdoors</li><li>Private lobby and lift access </li><li>2 x Designated parking spaces in the underground carpark Lockup storage unit in the underground carpark </li><li>Recessed lighting and Recessed speakers </li><li>GFCH</ul>"
